OL,3,GNEWSAServices disrupted after freight
OL,4,Atrain breaks down
OL,5,
OL,6,FA broken down freight train has blocked
OL,7,Frail lines causing disruption across
OL,8,FNorfolk and Suffolk.
OL,10,FThe freight train broke down between
OL,11,FIpswich and Needham Market and
OL,12,Fdisruption was expected until about
OL,13,F10:15 BST.
OL,15,FGreater Anglia said another train would
OL,16,Fhave to help move the freight, meaning
OL,17,Fservices could be delayed or cancelled.
OL,19,FTrains for Ipswich, Norwich, Cambridge
OL,20,Fand Peterborough have been affected.
